{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"type-alias-workflowevent","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Alias: WorkflowEvent"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type WorkflowEvent = \n  | {\n  audience?: string;\n  runId: string;\n  threadId?: string;\n  ts: number;\n  type: \"RUN_STARTED\";\n}\n  | {\n  audience?: string;\n  output: unknown;\n  runId: string;\n  ts: number;\n  type: \"RUN_FINISHED\";\n}\n  | {\n  audience?: string;\n  code: string;\n  error: SerializedError;\n  runId: string;\n  ts: number;\n  type: \"RUN_ERRORED\";\n}\n  | {\n  audience?: string;\n  meta?: WorkflowMetadata;\n  stepId: string;\n  ts: number;\n  type: \"STEP_STARTED\";\n}\n  | {\n  attempts?: ReadonlyArray<StepAttempt>;\n  audience?: string;\n  meta?: WorkflowMetadata;\n  result: unknown;\n  stepId: string;\n  ts: number;\n  type: \"STEP_FINISHED\";\n}\n  | {\n  attempts?: ReadonlyArray<StepAttempt>;\n  audience?: string;\n  error: SerializedError;\n  meta?: WorkflowMetadata;\n  stepId: string;\n  ts: number;\n  type: \"STEP_FAILED\";\n}\n  | {\n  audience?: string;\n  deadline?: number;\n  meta?: Record<string, unknown>;\n  name: string;\n  stepId: string;\n  ts: number;\n  type: \"SIGNAL_AWAITED\";\n}\n  | {\n  audience?: string;\n  meta?: WorkflowMetadata;\n  name: string;\n  payload: unknown;\n  signalId?: string;\n  stepId: string;\n  ts: number;\n  type: \"SIGNAL_RESOLVED\";\n}\n  | {\n  approvalId: string;\n  audience?: string;\n  description?: string;\n  meta?: WorkflowMetadata;\n  stepId: string;\n  title: string;\n  ts: number;\n  type: \"APPROVAL_REQUESTED\";\n}\n  | {\n  approvalId: string;\n  approved: boolean;\n  audience?: string;\n  feedback?: string;\n  meta?: WorkflowMetadata;\n  stepId: string;\n  ts: number;\n  type: \"APPROVAL_RESOLVED\";\n}\n  | {\n  audience?: string;\n  meta?: WorkflowMetadata;\n  stepId: string;\n  ts: number;\n  type: \"NOW_RECORDED\";\n  value: number;\n}\n  | {\n  audience?: string;\n  meta?: WorkflowMetadata;\n  stepId: string;\n  ts: number;\n  type: \"UUID_RECORDED\";\n  value: string;\n}\n  | {\n  audience?: string;\n  delta: ReadonlyArray<Operation>;\n  ts: number;\n  type: \"STATE_DELTA\";\n}\n  | {\n  audience?: string;\n  name: string;\n  ts: number;\n  type: \"CUSTOM\";\n  value: Record<string, unknown>;\n};","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/workflow/blob/main/packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts#L70","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts:70"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The shape of every event the engine appends to a run's log."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Two consumers, one shape:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Durability"}]},{"type":"text","value":": the engine appends events to the run's log.\nReplay reads the log and short-circuits primitives that have\na matching CHECKPOINT event by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"stepId"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Observability"}]},{"type":"text","value":": the engine emits the same events through\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"runWorkflow"},{"type":"text","value":"'s "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AsyncIterable<WorkflowEvent>"},{"type":"text","value":" and (if wired)\nthrough stream subscribers. A browser/UI subscribes to the\nsame log a Durable Streams URL would expose."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Events fall into two categories internally:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"loose":true,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Checkpoint events"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — replay uses these to skip already-\ncompleted work. Indexed by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"stepId"},{"type":"text","value":". STEP_FINISHED,\nSTEP_FAILED, SIGNAL_RESOLVED, APPROVAL_RESOLVED, NOW_RECORDED,\nUUID_RECORDED, RUN_FINISHED, RUN_ERRORED."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Coordination events"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — persisted so hosts and resume calls\ncan identify the pending wait. SIGNAL_AWAITED,\nAPPROVAL_REQUESTED."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Observability events"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — engine emits but replay ignores.\nRUN_STARTED, STEP_STARTED, STATE_DELTA, CUSTOM."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The optional "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"audience"},{"type":"text","value":" field is engine-ignored. Adapters/views\n(e.g., a Durable Streams projection layer) may filter on it to\nproduce internal vs client vs admin views of the same log."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-declaration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Declaration"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  audience?: string;\n  runId: string;\n  threadId?: string;\n  ts: number;\n  type: \"RUN_STARTED\";\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"audience","children":[{"type":"text","value":"audience?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional audience: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"runid","children":[{"type":"text","value":"runId"}]},{"type":"code","value":"runId: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"threadid","children":[{"type":"text","value":"threadId?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional threadId: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"ts","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ts"}]},{"type":"code","value":"ts: number;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"